K2 data:  the two light curves (data/EPIC201367065.csv and data/EPIC206154641.csv, two columns, time and flux) are light curves of the stars with those EPIC identifiers from the Kepler mission's K2 phase, as the TLS repository holds them for its tests. They are data of a NASA mission, public through the Mikulski Archive for Space Telescopes (MAST, https://archive.stsci.edu/missions-and-data/k2), and the MIT licence above is that of the TLS code and not of the data. The campaign and the pipeline of each file are not stated by TLS's repository and are not stated here.
